            <p><span class="bold">WTCs</span> means the Company’s Warranty Terms and Conditions, published at <a href="https://www.couriersandfreight.com.au/warranty-terms" target="_blank">www.couriersandfreight.com.au/warranty-terms</a>, as amended from time to time.</p>
